/* The ratchet.

   The flat core still has `noImplicitAny` off — 424 unannotated parameters, each a
   type decision rather than a mechanical fix. Rather than claim a file is strict-clean
   and hope, every module split out of the core is listed here and checked under full
   strictness by `npm run typecheck:strict`.

   Adding a file to this list is the last step of splitting it. If it will not pass,
   it is not finished.

   Only files that do not import the still-loose core can be listed: `include` does not
   stop TypeScript following an import, so adding `main.tsx` here pulled index.ts in
   with it and produced 400 errors from the file this list exists to exclude.
   main.tsx joins once index.ts is clean, which is also when the flag moves for good. */
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noImplicitAny": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true
  },
  "include": [
    "app/src/core/types.ts",
    "app/src/core/icons.ts"
  ]
}
